  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-midnightblue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absolute Cosmic Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/Genis-Vell_%28Earth-616%29_from_New_Thunderbolts_Vol_1_13_0002.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190605120241\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Genis-Vell (Earth-616) from New Thunderbolts Vol 1 13 0002\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/Genis-Vell_%28Earth-616%29_from_New_Thunderbolts_Vol_1_13_0002.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/329?cb=20190605120241\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/Genis-Vell_%28Earth-616%29_from_New_Thunderbolts_Vol_1_13_0002.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/329?cb=20190605120241 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/a0/Genis-Vell_%28Earth-616%29_from_New_Thunderbolts_Vol_1_13_0002.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190605120241 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Genis-Vell (Earth-616) from New Thunderbolts Vol 1 13 0002\" width=\"270\" height=\"410\" data-image-key=\"Genis-Vell_%28Earth-616%29_from_New_Thunderbolts_Vol_1_13_0002.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Genis-Vell (Earth-616) from New Thunderbolts Vol 1 13 0002.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Genis-Vell (Marvel Comics), with the Nega Bands, can infinitely absorb and store cosmic energy.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Store an infinite amount of cosmic energy in your body.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>store an infinite or nearly infinite amount of cosmic energy in your body</b>. Advanced version of <a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Cosmic Energy Absorption\">Cosmic Energy Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Energy Absorption\">Absolute Energy Absorption</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Cosmic_Transformer\" title=\"Bio-Cosmic Transformer\">Bio-Cosmic Transformer</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Cosmic_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absolute Cosmic Storage</li>\n<li>Infinite Cosmic Absorption</li>\n<li>Ultimate Cosmic Capacitor</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsolute_Cosmic_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user's body is capable of containing an infinite amount of cosmic energy, they can absorb as much as they want. This can allow the user the energy required to use other superhuman abilities, survive long amounts of time without food, or output energy for long periods of time.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span cla