 Perpetuator</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Condition_Infinitum\" title=\"Condition Infinitum\">Condition Infinitum</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Beauty_Infinitum\" title=\"Beauty Infinitum\">Beauty Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence_Infinitum\" title=\"Intelligence Infinitum\">Intelligence Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Level_Infinitum\" title=\"Power Level Infinitum\">Power Level Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speed_Infinitum\" title=\"Speed Infinitum\">Speed Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stamina_Infinitum\" title=\"Stamina Infinitum\">Stamina Infinitum</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength_Infinitum\" title=\"Strength Infinitum\">Strength Infinitum</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Accumulation\" title=\"Cosmic Accumulation\">Cosmic Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Concentration\" title=\"Cosmic Concentration\">Cosmic Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Regeneration\" title=\"Cosmic Regeneration\">Cosmic Regeneration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Attacks\" title=\"Cosmic Attacks\">Cosmic Attacks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Capacitor\" title=\"Cosmic Capacitor\">Cosmic Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Conversion\" title=\"Cosmic Conversion\">Cosmic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Energizing\" title=\"Cosmic Energizing\">Cosmic Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Cosmic_Transformer\" title=\"Bio-Cosmic Transformer\">Bio-Cosmic Transformer</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Empowerment\" title=\"Cosmic Empowerment\">Cosmic Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Condition/Absolute\" title=\"Peak Human Condition/Absolute\">Absolute Condition</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Pinnacle_Condition\" title=\"Pinnacle Condition\">Pinnacle Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li>\n<li><a h